{"cut_proposal":{"candidate_errors":[],"prefix":"Given that \\( f(x) \\) is a polynomial of degree 3, we can express it as \\( f(x) = ax^3 + bx^2 + cx + d \\). The points \\( A(2,4) \\), \\( B(3,9) \\), and \\( C(4,16) \\) lie on the graph of \\( y = f(x) \\), so we have the following equations:\n\\[ f(2) = 8a + 4b + 2c + d = 4, \\]\n\\[ f(3) = 27a + 9b + 3c + d = 9, \\]\n\\[ f(4) = 64a + 16b + 4c + d = 16. \\]\n\nWe need to find the intersections of the lines \\( AB \\), \\( AC \\), and \\( BC \\) with the graph of \\( y = f(x) \\) again. Let's find the equations of these lines first.\n\nThe equation of line \\( AB \\) passing through \\( A(2,4) \\) and \\( B(3,9) \\) is:\n\\[ y - 4 = \\frac{9-4}{3-2}(x-2) \\implies y - 4 = 5(x-2) \\implies y = 5x - 6. \\]\nSetting \\( y = f(x) \\), we get:\n\\[ ax^3 + bx^2 + cx + d = 5x - 6. \\]\nSince \\( x = 2 \\) and \\( x = 3 \\) are solutions, we can factor out \\( (x-2)(x-3) \\):\n\\[ ax^3 + bx^2 + cx + d - (5x - 6) = a(x-2)(x-3)(x-r_1) = 0. \\]\nThe sum of the roots of the polynomial \\( ax^3 + bx^2 + cx + d - (5x - 6) \\) is \\( 2 + 3 + r_1 = 5 + r_1 \\). The sum of the roots of a cubic polynomial \\( ax^3 + bx^2 + cx + d \\) is \\(-\\frac{b}{a}\\). Therefore, the sum of the roots of \\( f(x) - 5x + 6 \\) is \\( -\\frac{b}{a} \\), so \\( 5 + r_1 = -\\frac{b}{a} \\).\n\nSimilarly, for line \\( AC \\) passing through \\( A(2,4) \\) and \\( C(4,16) \\):\n\\[ y - 4 = \\frac{16-4}{4-2}(x-2) \\implies y - 4 = 6(x-2) \\implies y = 6x - 8. \\]\nSetting \\( y = f(x) \\), we get:\n\\[ ax^3 + bx^2 + cx + d = 6x - 8. \\]\nSince \\( x = 2 \\) and \\( x = 4 \\) are solutions, we can factor out \\( (x-2)(x-4) \\):\n\\[ ax^3 + bx^2 + cx + d - (6x - 8) = a(x-2)(x-4)(x-r_2) = 0. \\]\nThe sum of the roots of the polynomial \\( ax^3 + bx^2 + cx + d - (6x - 8) \\) is \\( 2 + 4 + r_2 = 6 + r_2 \\). The sum of the roots of a cubic polynomial \\( ax^3 + bx^2 + cx + d \\) is \\(-\\frac{b}{a}\\). Therefore, the sum of the roots of \\( f(x) - 6x + 8 \\) is \\( -\\frac{b}{a} \\), so \\( 6 + r_2 = -\\frac{b}{a} \\).\n\n","prefix_end":1892,"status":"review_required"},"eligible":true,"generation":{"generation":{"max_new_tokens":2048,"temperature":0.7,"top_k":0,"top_p":1.0},"ids":[22043,429,17767,282,2075,8,1124,8,374,264,47311,315,8381,220,18,11,582,646,3158,432,438,17767,282,2075,8,284,3859,61,18,488,44241,61,17,488,20716,488,294,1124,568,576,3501,17767,362,7,17,11,19,8,1124,701,17767,425,7,18,11,24,8,1124,701,323,17767,356,7,19,11,16,21,8,1124,8,10246,389,279,4771,315,17767,379,284,282,2075,8,1124,701,773,582,614,279,2701,37906,510,78045,282,7,17,8,284,220,23,64,488,220,19,65,488,220,17,66,488,294,284,220,19,11,1124,921,78045,282,7,18,8,284,220,17,22,64,488,220,24,65,488,220,18,66,488,294,284,220,24,11,1124,921,78045,282,7,19,8,284,220,21,19,64,488,220,16,21,65,488,220,19,66,488,294,284,220,16,21,13,1124,2533,1654,1184,311,1477,279,64257,315,279,5128,17767,14137,1124,701,17767,10584,1124,701,323,17767,18040,1124,8,448,279,4771,315,17767,379,284,282,2075,8,1124,8,1549,13,6771,594,1477,279,37906,315,1493,5128,1156,382,785,23606,315,1555,17767,14137,1124,8,12299,1526,17767,362,7,17,11,19,8,1124,8,323,17767,425,7,18,11,24,8,1124,8,374,510,78045,379,481,220,19,284,1124,37018,90,24,12,19,15170,18,12,17,25547,87,12,17,8,1124,6383,550,379,481,220,19,284,220,20,2075,12,17,8,1124,6383,550,379,284,220,20,87,481,220,21,13,1124,921,15400,17767,379,284,282,2075,8,1124,701,582,633,510,78045,3859,61,18,488,44241,61,17,488,20716,488,294,284,220,20,87,481,220,21,13,1124,921,12549,17767,856,284,220,17,1124,8,323,17767,856,284,220,18,1124,8,525,9904,11,582,646,8168,700,17767,320,87,12,17,2376,87,12,18,8,1124,982,78045,3859,61,18,488,44241,61,17,488,20716,488,294,481,320,20,87,481,220,21,8,284,264,2075,12,17,2376,87,12,18,2376,87,3795,62,16,8,284,220,15,13,1124,921,785,2629,315,279,19703,315,279,47311,17767,3859,61,18,488,44241,61,17,488,20716,488,294,481,320,20,87,481,220,21,8,1124,8,374,17767,220,17,488,220,18,488,435,62,16,284,22